# Build output
dist/
.astro/

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Generated content — synced from sibling packages by `yarn sync`.
# Each per-package directory holds BOTH synced files (sourced from
# `../<package>/skills/*.md`) and optional hand-authored ones like
# `getting-started.md`. Synced files carry a `# Synced from …` marker
# comment in their frontmatter. The directories are not gitignored so
# hand-authored pages stay tracked; the sync overwrites by filename.

# `public/llms-full.txt` is regenerated locally by `yarn build:llms`
# (concatenates every sibling package's `llms-full.txt`). It IS committed
# to git so CI (which has no sibling packages) can serve it as-is at
# `/llms-full.txt`. Remember to re-run `yarn build` before each push so
# the committed copy stays current.

